      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "For your detectives, consider creating an veteran \"institutionalist\" who strictly follows protocol, contrasted with a younger, weary officer seeking redemption who has lost faith in the system. On the criminal side, develop a charismatic but ruthless gang leader who empowers subordinates while making fatal errors, and a cunning \"fixer\" who operates outside the gang's direct control to sell outcomes under unpredictable prices. These archetypes will highlight the friction between institutional failure and street survival, anchoring your gritty narrative in believable social dynamics.",
