      "content": "Those are good starting points for the personalities, but I need more specificity for the casting process. To make it feel like a real, grounded show, I need to know about the demographics. When you're thinking about the \"look\" and \"vibe\" of these groups to ensure the show feels authentic to an inner-city setting, what kind of racial or ethnic backgrounds are you envisioning for the detectives versus the street-level criminal archetypes? I want to avoid making it feel generic or whitewashed.",
